    "detailed_description": "<h1>DISCORD CHANNEL</h1><p>Head over to the UNREST discord server<br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Epic Multiplayer TPS Experience</h2>Unrest offers players a breathtaking multiplayer TPS experience, with two teams of 5 players each in the main game mode, totaling 10 players. Take your place in the epic battle between humans and creatures!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902280/extras/3cb2aa4c30eb0b2c7cef68169466a809.poster.avif?t=1755454658\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902280/extras/3cb2aa4c30eb0b2c7cef68169466a809.webm?t=1755454658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902280/extras/3cb2aa4c30eb0b2c7cef68169466a809.mp4?t=1755454658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Colonist Invaders</h2>Colonists are brave humans who venture into the galaxy to establish colonies on various planets. Clash against the resistance with unique abilities and special equipment possessed by each class to secure victory!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Resistant Homeowners</h2>Though the creature team may appear aggressive, they are simply defending their homes! Showcase the power of the indigenous race, comprised of mighty creatures fighting to defend their planet, each equipped with various abilities, reminding humans who these lands belong to!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Invasion and Defense</h2>An extraordinary narrative unfolds as humans take on the role of invading colonists, while native creatures fight to protect their planet against human invasion, turning into a thrilling battle! Protect or destroy equipment in three different zones, advancing your team towards victory step by step!",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Epic Multiplayer TPS Experience</h2>Unrest offers players a breathtaking multiplayer TPS experience, with two teams of 5 players each in the main game mode, totaling 10 players. Take your place in the epic battle between humans and creatures!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902280/extras/3cb2aa4c30eb0b2c7cef68169466a809.poster.avif?t=1755454658\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902280/extras/3cb2aa4c30eb0b2c7cef68169466a809.webm?t=1755454658\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2902280/extras/3cb2aa4c30eb0b2c7cef68169466a809.mp4?t=1755454658\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Colonist Invaders</h2>Colonists are brave humans who venture into the galaxy to establish colonies on various planets. Clash against the resistance with unique abilities and special equipment possessed by each class to secure victory!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Resistant Homeowners</h2>Though the creature team may appear aggressive, they are simply defending their homes! Showcase the power of the indigenous race, comprised of mighty creatures fighting to defend their planet, each equipped with various abilities, reminding humans who these lands belong to!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Invasion and Defense</h2>An extraordinary narrative unfolds as humans take on the role of invading colonists, while native creatures fight to protect their planet against human invasion, turning into a thrilling battle! Protect or destroy equipment in three different zones, advancing your team towards victory step by step!",
    "short_description": "Choose your side in the futuristic struggle between colonist humans and resistant alien creatures. Prove who is superior in adrenaline-filled space battles with a unique gameplay experience!",
